  "_readme": [
    "ALL DATA IS FICTIONAL. Every document has isTestData: true so it is easy to find and delete.",
    "Collection and field names are PROPOSED. The app has no Firestore code yet (app/lib has only main.dart, firebase_options.dart and new_booking_page.dart).",
    "The first four equipment items copy the hardcoded inventory in app/lib/new_booking_page.dart (name, category, details, total).",
    "The booking page currently collects only a date range and a set of item names. Quantities, customer details and statuses are additions for testing.",
    "'available' is not stored: it is computed as totalQuantity - unitsInMaintenance - quantities on overlapping non-cancelled bookings.",
    "Replace every UID_* value with the real Firebase Auth UID after creating the accounts. Replace UID_DISPATCH_2 BEFORE UID_DISPATCH.",
    "Dates are ISO strings here; enter them as Firestore Timestamp. Quantities are Number. 'system' is a literal string, not a UID.",
    "UID_FORMER_STAFF is a Firestore document only (a disabled account for admin tests); it needs no Auth account."
